    {
      "id": "p0022-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "At first glance, this literal translation seems fine. But for people unfamiliar with Japanese economics, it's unclear just how much money this is. Is it a lot? Is it very little? A literal translation still leaves questions for those outside the in-group.",
